<http://data.silknow.org/object/3e8b1f6c-ebda-308f-9306-d3a69c238c95/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lady's dress of challis (silk and wool), printed in colours. It has a high waist, and full sleeves which are pleated at the shoulders and close fitting at the wrists. Printed with cornucopia alternately reversed and repeated in upright bands. The ground is divided into squares by narrow vertical stripes in pink silk, crossed by horizontal stripes printed in green. The waist-band is of the same pattern. The bodice is trimmed with silk ribbon and there is an edging of silk lace round the neck."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3e8b1f6c-ebda-308f-9306-d3a69c238c95> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/3e8b1f6c-ebda-308f-9306-d3a69c238c95>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Lady's dress of challis (silk and wool), printed in colours. It has a high waist, and full sleeves which are pleated at the shoulders and close fitting at the wrists. Printed with cornucopia alternately reversed and repeated in upright bands. The ground is divided into squares by narrow vertical stripes in pink silk, crossed by horizontal stripes printed in green. The waist-band is of the same pattern. The bodice is trimmed with silk ribbon and there is an edging of silk lace round the neck."@en , "Lady's dress with waistband, printed challis, England, 1835-1840."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2b17a448-e8f5-30e9-906a-a6ade852609c> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/61c353fd-b7b7-35a9-b442-72124b889f05> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/77e7d82c-63a5-3961-a0fe-3b9ccee42e78> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e1881637-6a31-3f10-b847-3dda2f6ae771> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Lady's dress of challis (silk and wool), printed in colours. It has a high waist, and full sleeves which are pleated at the shoulders and close fitting at the wrists. Printed with cornucopia alternately reversed and repeated in upright bands. The ground is divided into squares by narrow vertical stripes in pink silk, crossed by horizontal stripes printed in green. The waist-band is of the same pattern. The bodice is trimmed with silk ribbon and there is an edging of silk lace round the neck."@en , "Lady's dress with waistband, printed challis, England, 1835-1840."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "1650&A-1901" ;
